Dolphy courses
==============

The course "JavaScript: language" (javascript/) follows the structure and topics
of the "Modern JavaScript Tutorial" (https://javascript.info, Russian edition:
https://learn.javascript.ru, source: https://github.com/javascript-tutorial/ru.javascript.info)
by Ilya Kantor, part "The JavaScript language".

The lesson texts, quiz questions, coding tasks and tests were rewritten for the Dolphy
format; the material was changed and adapted. The original tutorial is licensed by
its author under terms that are basically CC BY-NC (attribution, non-commercial use only):
https://github.com/javascript-tutorial/ru.javascript.info/blob/master/LICENSE.md

Accordingly, this repository is distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0 (see LICENSE).
It is NOT endorsed by the author of the original tutorial. Any commercial use
requires permission from the original author.
